曦微露到暮色四合间🌆，将每一个平凡的晨昏🎈，都酿成了心底温润的诗行。我以滚烫的热忱🏃‍♀️，作为生活的注脚，在每一次俯身耕耘、抬手播种中，聆听成长的足音💫，在每一次微小的拔节里👣，细品奋斗馈赠的甘饴🍯。\n\n生活的惊喜啊，总爱躲在某个转角🌸，等我们以虔诚的目光去发现，以温柔的双手去拾起✨。我欣悦于那种「破茧成蝶」的蜕变🌱，恰似种子顶开顽石，在一次次探索中汲取力量🌧️，在每一次蛰伏后绽放新的生机🌱。这份执着的热爱☀️，让步履愈发坚实，让心境愈发澄明。\n\n我怀揣着求知的星火🧠，在岁月的书页里孜孜不倦——每一次阅读都是与智者的对谈，每一次体验都是灵魂的拓荒?", "isMine": true, "isOfficial": false, "cardShareImageUrl": "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/image/20260204/5f4c6d34d94b8c26f38baad938268368cc75e09cccf17518b1194450de614c01.png", "memberStatus": false, "memberExpireDate": "2025/12/29", "circleMemberId": "2018867915568107521", "applyTime": null, "isOwner": true}], "isCircleExist": true, "checkInStatus": 2, "backgroundUrl": "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/public/card/background/circle/default.png", "hasActivity": false}], "total": 25, "nextStartId": null}, "msg": ""}, "header": {"Date": "Wed, 04 Feb 2026 13:13:59 GMT", "Content-Type": "application/json;charset=UTF-8", "Transfer-Encoding": "chunked", "Connection": "keep-alive", "lubanops-gtrace-id": "v-1108663-1770210839535-365", "lubanops-nenv-id": "2307110", "Access-Control-Allow-Origin": "*", "Access-Control-Allow-Methods": "GET, POST, PUT, DELETE, OPTIONS", "Access-Control-Allow-Headers": "*", "Access-Control-Allow-Credentials": "true", "trace-id": "", "Vary": "Origin,Access-Control-Request-Method,Access-Control-Request-Headers", "X-Content-Type-Options": "nosniff", "X-XSS-Protection": "0", "Cache-Control": "no-cache, no-store, max-age=0, must-revalidate", "Pragma": "no-cache", "Expires": "0", "Strict-Transport-Security": "max-age=31536000 ; includeSubDomains", "Server": "elb", "appservice-request-id": "5203"}, "statusCode": 200, "cookies": [], "accelerateType": "none", "errMsg": "request:ok"}, "mocked": false}
